A. Commit message:
Fixed CVE-2024-56374 -- Mitigated potential DoS in IPv6 validation.

B. Change summary:
Updated the max_length for GenericIPAddressField to prevent excessively long IPv6 addresses from causing a denial-of-service vulnerability. Added length validation checks and tests to ensure only valid IPv6 addresses within the defined maximum length are accepted.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

D. Fixed Code:
